847	        /// <summary>
848	        /// Neighbors' daily lives aren't simulated, so their friendships can't deepen the way ours
849	        /// do. Each year their bonds are scaled so a typical neighbor is as tied to their people as a
850	        /// typical one of ours, so that both sides weigh the same when a couple decides who moves.
